{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば皆さん、今更ながら先週の乃木坂ってどこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見て頂けましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/flair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃんとあみはエロ線などというものがあったみたいで…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"島田秀平さんにエロ２トップだと言われてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾁｰﾝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやだーーそんなんじゃないよー全くもって恥ずかしいよーーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれだよ皆、\nエロ線があるからってあみの事嫌いになんかなったらねえ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"許さないんだからねーっ（-＞_＜-）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）ﾃﾞｼｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…………………はい話は切り替えて…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近、あみ達はたくさんの番組に出演させていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズファクトリー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HEY!HEY!HEY!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージックジャパン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージックラバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にあみ達にとって夢のような時間で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその中でもいっぱいいっぱい学ぶ事があったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビュー前にもかかわらずこんなに幸せな経験をさせていただいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方々に感謝です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ達まだまだ、頑張りますよ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※各番組のオンエアの日時は、また次に書きまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/02/10/120210_2230010001.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}